{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/abd0c28940057ff05f0c1694bf1489f8.avif?t=1758274273\" width=1368 height=470 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/5fbb193469c498384d5f38672b91bfa8.poster.avif?t=1758274273\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/5fbb193469c498384d5f38672b91bfa8.webm?t=1758274273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/5fbb193469c498384d5f38672b91bfa8.mp4?t=1758274273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About AETHUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Maeve</strong> - ex-mining engineer for the <i><strong>Astral Resource Corporation</strong></i> (<strong>ARC</strong>), a galactic megacorp that profits by draining entire planets of their resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She\u2019s left the company...\u00a0<strong>ARC has not left her, however.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nothing but her basic mining equipment, tales from her beloved grandpa and her sarcastic AI drone companion,\u00a0<strong>Roland</strong>, she works to build a stable life of her own, outside of ARC\u2019s control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel a <strong>dystopian capitalist conspiracy</strong> as you delve through the remnants of <strong>a doomed expedition</strong> and the <strong>abandoned facilities they've left behind</strong>.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/42cdad07f08eb62dd2645512d389df13.webp?t=1758274273\" width=610 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/f8cbd14cbfb7b2d13da1dd1cd0b176d4.poster.avif?t=1758274273\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/f8cbd14cbfb7b2d13da1dd1cd0b176d4.webm?t=1758274273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/f8cbd14cbfb7b2d13da1dd1cd0b176d4.mp4?t=1758274273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/9ac234b97c81455887c27dab97ef445e.avif?t=1758274273\" width=1368 height=130 /></span>Use the\u00a0<strong>simple but powerful</strong> modular building system to create your own <strong>perfectly optimised  base</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow plants, raise fish and prospect for gems</strong> in your cozy habitats which you can <strong>decorate with almost any item you come across</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/30e36b90e1752fc56b738cb32e5fe5f4.avif?t=1758274273\" width=610 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/603a0b470b727f21ca64700cde096673.avif?t=1758274273\" width=610 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/ca3234eec3d0655b33c5f5c1c998fe7b.poster.avif?t=1758274273\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/ca3234eec3d0655b33c5f5c1c998fe7b.webm?t=1758274273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/ca3234eec3d0655b33c5f5c1c998fe7b.mp4?t=1758274273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/26b0056572eb4d3a6974014fa920c95b.avif?t=1758274273\" width=1368 height=130 /></span>Descend underground and use lasers, explosives, drills and more to gather <strong>hundreds of types of resources</strong> from your mining claim then <strong>refine them</strong> and <strong>craft new tools</strong> for exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/84e5e3ae9b58dad954c8c47dde0105f0.webp?t=1758274273\" width=610 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/51e84226174dc3c48328f3ca36a0a8a6.avif?t=1758274273\" width=610 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/10527e7cc009f21b1163f006fce07aef.poster.avif?t=1758274273\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/10527e7cc009f21b1163f006fce07aef.webm?t=1758274273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/10527e7cc009f21b1163f006fce07aef.mp4?t=1758274273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/0f53855a931cbc089d046179163c6b15.avif?t=1758274273\" width=1368 height=130 /></span><strong>Built from the ground-up with story at its heart</strong>, uncover a <strong>dystopian corporate conspiracy</strong> and <i>decide how far</i><strong> </strong><i>you\u2019re willing to go for the truth</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story is not an afterthought in AETHUS, there's always narrative to drive you forward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/0205da48a5899d725bf68fb9806d8d46.webp?t=1758274273\" width=610 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/01ef538772deed5a5a9eb10b41cf64be.webp?t=1758274273\" width=610 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/92512865894732c3d57a3723115adc8b.avif?t=1758274273\" width=459 height=285 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/2bbc2b3eeade98662c642cd201db6bc7.avif?t=1758274273\" width=1368 height=130 /></span><strong>AETHUS</strong> is being created by <i>Pawsmonaut Games</i> - a <strong>solo-indie</strong> developer based in <i>Edinburgh, Scotland</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am self-published, self-funded, and fully committed to old-fashioned <i>ethical</i> game development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>No AI usage, no early access, no microtransactions or purchaseable cosmetics.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please wishlist the game if it looks interesting to you - it really helps!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2541530?t=1758274273","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2541530?t=1758274273","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/cd6dd92cfe0cea681bb16d4c3ac27a83de3862e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758274273","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/cd6dd92cfe0cea681bb16d4c3ac27a83de3862e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758274273","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2822250,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/abd0c28940057ff05f0c1694bf1489f8.avif?t=1758274273\" width=1368 height=470 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat